# Restrict Docker build context to what scripts/build-compactc-docker.sh needs:
# the compact/ submodule (excluding its .git) and scripts/.
# Other docker tooling in the repo (testkit-js/compose.yml, etc.) only consumes
# external images and never runs `docker build`, so this restrictive baseline
# is safe.

*
!compact/
!scripts/

# Cull noise inside the included paths
compact/.git
compact/.github
compact/target
compact/node_modules
compact/dist
compact/build
**/*.md
